11
01:13:56,666 --> 01:14:02,666
It stars Johnny Depp, Gary Farmer, Billy Bob Thornton, Iggy Pop, Crispin Glover, John Hurt, Michael Wincott,
Lance Henriksen, Gabriel Byrne, Mili Avital, and Robert Mitchum in his final film performance.

12
01:20:40,000 --> 01:20:46,000
The movie, set in the late 19th century, follows William Blake, a
meek accountant on the run after killing a man.

13
01:27:23,333 --> 01:27:29,333
He has a chance encounter with enigmatic Native American spirit-guide "Nobody", who
believes Blake is the reincarnation of the visionary English poet William Blake.

14
01:34:06,666 --> 01:34:12,666
Described by Jarmusch as a "Psychedelic western", the
film is shot entirely in monochrome.

15
01:40:50,000 --> 01:40:56,000
Neil Young composed the guitar-dominated soundtrack with portions
he improvised while watching the movie footage.

16
01:47:33,333 --> 01:47:39,333
The film explores themes of dying and death,
sheriff, bounty hunter, gun, indigenous.

17
01:54:16,666 --> 01:54:22,666
The tone is emotional.
